{"parse": {"title": "TTS-22", "pageid": 141725, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-21\" title=\"TTS-21\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-22</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">22</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A9.E6.98.A5.EF.BC.8C.E5.9C.A8.E8.AF.BA.E7.93.A6.E7.B1.B3.E5.A5.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"早春，在诺瓦米奇\">早春，在诺瓦米奇</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 早春，在诺瓦米奇</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Spring of Nowa Miedź</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>好<span class=\"color-value\"></span>好<span class=\"color-value\"></span>睡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>太<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阳<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>经<span class=\"color-value\"></span>升<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810122</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuiyishiting\"><img alt=\"jijinhuiyishiting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你们现在看到的，是基金会“诺瓦米奇办事处”的草图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>它是我们在第一次“时空灾害”……抱歉，现在已经正式更名为“暴雨”了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师及时纠正了自己的措辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>它是我们在第一次“暴雨”后，正式启动施工的第一个项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这座建筑在设计之初，就被定义为一种“可扩展结构”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>它不仅能抵御极端天气，也为未来的功能叠加预留了空间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>当然，建筑自身的结构以及回声石的作用仅限当地，无法进一步复制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但有了成功的先例，我们会陆续在其他地方寻找“不可回溯地”并建立避难所、仓库、实验室，作为抵御“暴雨”的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>因此，基金会需要更多具备建筑设计、工程与城市规划背景的人才。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>未来你们将参与的，并非单体建筑项目，而是一套持续生长的系统……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-523601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-523601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-523601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>咦，右下角怎么有一朵小花？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有外勤调查员举起了手，毕业于名校建筑学专业的他难以忽视图纸上的每一个细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人的视线落在角落那朵孤零零的黄色小花上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那是雏菊，四月的时候，诺瓦米奇办事处那里会开一些。它是我的一位朋友画的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我们都很想念她。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>奠基石女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>噢……好久不见，希曼女士，露西女士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我从蓝图那里听说了，你们是来参加建立“暴雨”应急系统的初步会议的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>是的。多亏了你们，基金会已经陆续在能够抵御“暴雨”的地点开展应急设施建设了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>不过在“暴雨”应急系统中，各部门的职责范围与协作边界，还有很多需要商讨的细节……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>好久不见，奠基石女士。这应该是诺瓦米奇项目后，我们第一次见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>噢……还真是！项目结束后，我就被派去了普列谢茨克，对那处被证实为“不可回溯地”的拉普拉斯办公室进行评估。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>或许这就是建筑师的宿命吧。一个项目接着另一个项目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师无奈摊手。她脸上的黑眼圈依然醒目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>无论如何，你们都达成了一项了不起的成就。“诺瓦米奇办事处”总算正式竣工了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不……还远谈不上完成。一年后我还得回去，做一点儿回访调查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>建筑落成的时刻，一切才刚刚开始……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光顺着走廊缓缓扫过——比起上一次来访，这里明显热闹了许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的研究员、建筑师与新入职的员工来来往往，交谈声在空间中回荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其中有不少陌生的面孔，神情专注而热切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……正如复苏的基金会一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远在走廊的另一头，两道身影静静伫立在建筑投下的阴影中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们并未靠近，只是望向建筑师一行人的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>不上去打个招呼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>别这样看着我。早在她回总部的第一天，我们已就普列谢茨克的改造项目进行过磋商了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>那就好。希望你们今后也能保持良好的合作关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>委员发出一声轻叹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>在我看来，诺瓦米奇项目只是一次基于成本考量而达成的暂时妥协。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>在这一次的“暴雨”中，绝大部分分部成员依然没能免于回溯，并不比第一次好多少——从这一点来看，我们无疑是幸运的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>然而，这种幸运建立在极其脆弱的基础上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>未来我们依旧要避免出现类似的“意外”，我希望基金会的运转是整体可控而收敛的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>那不是“意外”，而是“奇迹”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>在我看来，一个收敛的系统中很难诞生出“奇迹”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这取决于我们处在什么样的阶段，肯纳女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>我不是什么老顽固，只是早早学会了认清现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>明白……祝你工作愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人朝相反的方向离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其中一人走入走廊尽头的阴影中，脚步声逐渐隐没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一人则转身，踏入明亮的光线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>廊外阳光正好。这是一个再普通不过的晴天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一年后</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1987年4月3日 天气晴</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>和奠基石女士一同前往诺瓦米奇办事处进行建筑回访调查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>已经很久没有回去了，我猜……那里应该有了一些了不得的变化。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>好……这样一来，诺瓦米奇的项目就要告一段落了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她合上笔记本，轻轻将它放在桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>书桌被打扫得很干净，几本有些陈旧的笔记本整齐地放在旁边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这还是我长大后第一次去东欧呢，见识到了很多有趣的家伙，还有美丽的光……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻声说着，嘴角带着一丝孩子气的笑意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>今天就先聊到这里啦，爷爷。我有种预感……一切都会越来越好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>诺瓦米奇也一样。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>依旧是冷清的街道，风穿过空荡的街口，吹动褪色的招牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一如既往。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>和我们当初来的时候比起来，这里的面貌似乎变化不大……但我感觉到，它的内核好像生长出了一些新的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>和之前相比，日子是好了一点儿，人也跟着变了一些，但不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>一些变化走到我们这样的小城，总要慢上几步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>我们不急，慢慢来就是了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老妇人乐呵呵地站在灰色的天空前，仿佛街道的一部分，从未离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的头巾洗得发旧，却还保留着几朵小小的花卉，是这里少见的暖色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>哎呀，孩子，脸都快掉到衣领里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>走吧……带你们去办事处看看，兴许能换个心情。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/Cg-3_8_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/Cg-3_8_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/Cg-3_8_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同样冰冷的立面、石柱、地板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>甚至连墙砖上的花纹都一模一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我还以为自己回到了基金会的总部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>心情并没有变好……感觉就像在上班……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这叫成本控制、可复用性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>资金能到位的话，什么风格我都能给你安排上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>办事处刚修好的时候，附近一带还是空的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>后来先是雇了一些本地人，在外头做杂事——看门、搬东西、打扫……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>亚肖他们都在这里干了好一阵子才离开的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>再后来，他们又把外头整理出来，铺了路，放上长椅，好让人能坐一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人的声音又低又缓，眼神里带着温和的感激。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>我想，诺瓦米奇就是这样一点点被改变的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>某种程度上……你们也改变了基金会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些曾在霓虹灯下反复修改的草图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尘土、砖石，还有一双双劳作的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终将一切带离那个灰蒙蒙的阴天，来到光下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>怎么，想到什么有趣的事了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我忽然想起来，第一次见到那家伙的时候，大概就在这个位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师一边回忆，一边笨拙地比划着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那时候光洒在她身上，将她的面容切割成两块截然不同的立面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>然后她唱起了一首歌……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>是《母亲远行之时》吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>没想到你也记得。我还以为，只有我一个人把那些旧事留着呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>令人印象深刻。我想这很难让人忘记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人静默了一瞬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如果你们不介意的话……我想独自去中庭看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>当然。按照你当时的要求，那里还保留着原来的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>依旧是熟悉的静谧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾经缠绕其间的噪音，此刻早已消失不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师仰起脸。<br />光自高处倾泻而下，在她的面庞与墙面之间缓缓流动。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_04\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-3_8_at_04.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"255\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-3_8_at_04.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-3_8_at_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2540\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗莎：</div><div>斯塔夏——你跑得太慢啦！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_21\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-3_8_at_21.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-3_8_at_21.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-3_8_at_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>……房子会记得的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_08\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Cg-3_8_at_08.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Cg-3_8_at_08.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Cg-3_8_at_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-314518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-314518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-314518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>雏菊……还记得吗？这里有很多雏菊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>往日种种，在光中重新显现——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不再喧哗，也不争辩，只是安静地被记起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你从不想向未来宣告什么，只想为过去留一处栖身之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这才是你真实的“存在意欲”——存在本身的回声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记忆一层层涌现，建筑师觉得有些累了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她靠向一面洁净的墙，闭上双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在静谧中，意识终于得以暂停……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i><span style=\"font-size:127%\">我走遍坟墓无所获……</span></i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_8_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师起身，循着声音的源头望去——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_28.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_28\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_28\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_8_at_28.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_28.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_8_at_28.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_28.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_8_at_28.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_28.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一只小小的、身着白色围裙的手偶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它坐在雏菊盛开的花丛中，与建筑师遥相对望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>小洪扎……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-314017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你在这里的话，那就是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风穿过花丛，光影微微晃动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过去不曾远离，歌声也将永远继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如影随形，永不消失——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i><span style=\"font-size:127%\">你猜对了，正巧是我。</span></i></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-22"}}